{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t「粵艇南下」明日首航，海事處處長王世發表示，首日有5艘內地遊艇，獲批來港。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n王世發表示，當局會監察訪港遊艇狀況，並加強在錨泊區巡邏，強調執法時會一視同仁。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：朱錫君\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T12:00:13.174488+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":84,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T11:46:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T03:18:05.394184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T11:57:45.255334+00:00","content_hash":"184f963506b25f2e3c2873d3954ccee732b418d0338065306b3bbf4587e3b3c7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}